13. Testing and Verification

Verify the following workflows before considering the project complete:

A new user can register.
A registered user can sign in and sign out.
An authenticated user can create a Markdown note.
The note persists after refreshing the page.
The user can edit and delete their notes.
Markdown formatting renders correctly.
Search, tags, pinning, and archiving work.
Unauthenticated users cannot access private notes.
User A cannot read or modify User B's notes, even if User A knows a note's ID.
Invalid inputs produce useful errors.
The app handles empty states and database failures gracefully.
The production build succeeds.

Add meaningful tests for authentication, authorization, and core note operations where practical.

